Package: adamqcworkbench
Title: ADaM QC Workbench Prototype
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Prototype", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "prototype@example.invalid")
Description: A Shiny prototype for bounded, human-in-the-loop independent QC of ADaM datasets during SAS-to-R migration. Deterministic comparison of uploaded datasets with human disposition and a session audit log. No AI, SAS runner, or external services.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: shiny, haven
